<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS BUY 34.05 MLN RAND S.AFRICAN BONDS THUR.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS BUY 34.05 MLN RAND S.AFRICAN BONDS THUR.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 34.05 million rand worth of South African bonds on Thursday after buying 62.67 million rand the previous day, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
